    "topo": {
      "accesAval": "Drive all the way from the beginning (Näfels) to the end of the Linthtal (Linthtal). From there turn left and drive to the very end of Tierfehd, there is a big parking.\n\nCall 1 day in advanced the taxi service +41 79 426 27 15. it costs 15CHF for one way to Hintersand. If you have a bike, then its very convinient to bike down after the canyon.",
      "accesAmont": null,
      "approche": "If you don't take the Alpentaxi then you have to start at Tierfehd and walk all the way up in direction Hintersand on a very good way. It takes about 1h20min.\n\nAt Hintersand walk up the very good path to Obersand/Planurahütte for about 1h and 560Hm.\n\nYou cross with the hiking-path at 1870m directly the start of the canyon.",
      "descente": "Very beautiful and perfectly scultped rock for the first 3 abseils. Amazing start with natural bridges! Followed by big abseils in a nice ambiente. The end is reddish rock with some good pools.",
      "retour": "Walk for 5min downstream and escape to the right and catch up with the hiking path",
      "engagement": null,
      "periode": null,
      "geologie": null,
      "historique": "First Descent: Flip Grimm & Matthias Holzinger 15.09.2014",
      "remarques": "Check the waterflow which comes in to the watercapture"
    },
